cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "EdgeCloud Emergency AI Prototype: evidence budgeting for edge AI under degraded connectivity"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, synthetic generator, real-data pipeline and frozen
  result files for a validation study of evidence budgeting across concurrent
  incident windows. Contains the nine-condition synthetic benchmark, the
  adversarial-metadata sweeps, the packet-loss and measured-capacity experiments,
  the decentralisation study, the compute-cost measurement, and the CrisisMMD
  real-data comparison with its split-robustness rotations.
